sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (Alice)
    participant WS as WebSocket Server
    participant FG as Friend Graph
    participant C_Cache as Redis Cache
    participant PS as Redis Pub/Sub
    participant K as Kafka
    participant W as Worker
    participant DB as Cassandra

    %% Connection & Initialization
    C->>WS: Connect WebSocket
    WS->>FG: Get friends of Alice
    FG-->>WS: Return [Bob, Charlie]
    WS->>C_Cache: MGET locations for [Bob, Charlie]
    C_Cache-->>WS: Return locations
    WS->>WS: Filter friends > 5 miles away
    WS-->>C: Initial nearby friends list
    WS->>PS: Subscribe to channel:user:Bob, channel:user:Charlie

    %% Location Update
    C->>WS: Location Update (lat, lng, ts)
    WS->>C_Cache: SETEX loc:Alice (10m TTL)
    WS->>PS: PUBLISH channel:user:Alice
    WS-)K: Async publish event
    
    %% Async Persistence
    K-)W: Consume event
    W-)DB: Batch Write Location History

    %% Receiving Friend Update
    PS-->>WS: Update from channel:user:Bob
    WS->>WS: Check if Bob within 5 miles
    WS-->>C: Forward Bob's new location
